### 获取商品接口使用的登录凭证
# @name productLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"admin","password":"12345678"}

###

### 为商品创建 SKU
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products/1/skus
Authorization: Bearer {{productLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "GO-COURSE-001",
  "specs": {
    "版本": "电子版"
  },
  "price_cent": 9900,
  "stock": 100
}

### product_id 非法
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products/abc/skus
Authorization: Bearer {{productLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "GO-COURSE-002",
  "specs": {
    "版本": "纸质版"
  },
  "price_cent": 19900,
  "stock": 10
}

### SKU 参数非法
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products/1/skus
Authorization: Bearer {{productLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "bad-code",
  "specs": {},
  "price_cent": 0,
  "stock": -1
}
